    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't feel true. they're always stressed or worried about me or the bills or how i'm doing. it feels like my life is just this constant drain on their energy. like, they'd actually have more freedom and peace if they didn't have to constantly worry about me or try to fix my messes.",
