      "content": "i just keep thinking about how much easier life would be for them if i wasnt even in the picture. if they didnt have to spend every day trying to lift me up or dealing with the mess i make. it feels like the kindest thing i could do is just... stop being a problem for them. it feels like a way to finally give them some peace.",
